{"t": 1795077415.5889785, "tool": "analyze", "code": "from scipy.optimize import least_squares\nvar=np.var(dA_dt)\nmodels={\n 'A^n*exp(-k t*A)': lambda p: p[0]+p[1]*(1-p[2]*np.exp(-p[3]*t)) + p[4]*A**p[5]*np.exp(-p[6]*t*A),\n 'A^n*exp(-k t)*A(sat)': lambda p: p[0]+p[1]*(1-p[2]*np.exp(-p[3]*t)) + p[4]*A**p[5]*np.exp(-p[6]*t)*A,\n 'A^n*(1-exp(-kt))': lambda p: p[0]+p[1]*(1-p[2]*np.exp(-p[3]*t)) + p[4]*A**p[5]*(1-p[6]*np.exp(-p[7]*t)),\n 'A^n*t^m': lambda p: p[0]+p[1]*(1-p[2]*np.exp(-p[3]*t)) + p[4]*A**p[5]*t**p[6],\n 'logistic-ish': lambda p: p[0]*A**p[1]/(1+p[2]*A**p[3]*np.exp(-p[4]*t)) + p[5]*(1-np.exp(-p[6]*t)),\n}\nrng=np.random.default_rng(0)\nfor name,f in models.items():\n    bestr=np.inf;bp=None\n    for trial in range(40):\n        p0=rng.uniform(0.2,2,8)\n        try:\n            r=least_squares(lambda p: f(p)-dA_dt, p0, max_nfev=3000)\n            v=np.mean(r.fun**2)/var\n            if np.isfinite(v) and v<bestr: bestr=v;bp=r.x\n        except Exception as e: pass\n    print(name, bestr, np.round(bp,3) if bp is not None else None)", "out": "(no output; use print)"}
